InvertingInput|OPAMP_INVERTINGINPUT_IO0|OPAMP Inverting Input IO0
InvertingInput|OPAMP_INVERTINGINPUT_IO1|OPAMP Inverting Input IO1
InvertingInput|OPAMP_INVERTINGINPUT_CONNECT_NO|OPAMP INVERTINGINPUT CONNECT NO
